<title>JAPAN: Toei Reefer - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Toei Reefer - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  4.95		vs	    4.61</p>
<p> Operating	  174    million	  vs	  140    million</p>
<p> Current	    177    million	  vs	  167    million</p>
<p> Net		   89    million	  vs	  121    million</p>
